    <string name="i18n_g4_settings_spo2_estimate_detail">Surfaces your strap\'s nightly SpO₂ estimate in the Blood Oxygen tile when no calibrated percentage is available: a WHOOP 5.0/MG\'s @82 candidate byte, or an Oura ring\'s own reading with each sample capped at 100% first (the ring\'s raw reading runs high otherwise). This is an UNVERIFIED strap-computed value — the WHOOP candidate matched a reference device closely on most nights but moved opposite on some; the Oura one has only been checked against a few nights so far. Shown as an \'estimate\' and never fed into recovery or illness scoring. Off by default.</string>
    <string name="i18n_g4_settings_stress_baseline_detail">Scores today\'s hour-by-hour stress timeline against YOUR own cross-day baseline (how your days usually run, Oura-style) instead of the day\'s own calm hours. The cutoff is tuned from a single-subject reference so far, so it\'s an alternative lens, not the default. HR-only; never fed into recovery or illness scoring. Off by default.</string>
